WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:08.750
Fearing a German invasion, in 1940 Alan Turing
converted his assets into silver ingots and

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:10.670
buried them in Buckinghamshire.

00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:16.070
He spent the rest of his life failing to find
them.

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:28.410
In 2014, a single parking space in London
was sold for £400,000.

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:34.030
The Duke of Wellington's horse, Copenhagen,
died from eating too many sponge cakes, bath

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:36.020
buns and chocolate creams.

00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:43.350
In 2013, nine babies born in the UK were named
Cheese.

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:47.760
The International Space Station travels at
five miles a second.

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:54.829
It's impossible to get lost in a labyrinth:
unlike mazes, labyrinths have only one possible

00:00:54.829 --> 00:00:56.329
route.

00:00:56.329 --> 00:01:02.190
Chewbacca's voice was created by combining
the sounds of a bear, a walrus, a lion and

00:01:02.190 --> 00:01:04.330
a badger.

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:08.350
People eat less in subdued lighting conditions.

00:01:08.350 --> 00:01:12.840
President George W. Bush was once a cheerleader.

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:15.560
Bananas have more trade regulations than AK-47s.

00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:23.840
Taking a photo of something reduces your ability
to remember it.

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:30.479
In parts of Western China, it is customary
to put salt in your tea instead of sugar.

00:01:30.479 --> 00:01:39.280
The Great Pyramid of Giza was built by 100,000
people working 10 hours a day for 20 years.

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:45.039
After getting out of the bath, the ancient
Greeks covered themselves with olive oil.

00:01:45.039 --> 00:01:50.469
Each day 22% of people skip lunch.

00:01:50.469 --> 00:01:59.890
It would take 225 million years to walk a
light year.

